Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/Genotomi/erikos

Package: erik-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Erik OS package repository signing key and APT source
 Installs the public key that signs the Erik OS APT repository and
 the APT source entry for it, so that Erik tools install with
 "sudo apt install erik-<tool>". The key is used only for the Erik
 repository (Signed-By), never trusted for Debian archives.
